        "image": "modules/dxcufgbs-player-bastions/assets/codex/bedroom.webp",
        "icon": "modules/dxcufgbs-player-bastions/assets/codex/icons/bedroom.webp",
        "description": "<p>Somewhere to sleep that isn't the floor of the hall. A bedroom holds the household's beds, chests and a hearth, and every Bastion needs a few before anyone wants to stay the winter.</p><p>Bedrooms add beds, so more people can live at the Bastion without crowding, and they become one of the owners' basic facilities. A larger bedroom holds more beds and can be enlarged later.</p>"
      },
