        "icon": "modules/dxcufgbs-player-bastions/assets/codex/icons/courtyard.webp",
        "description": "<p>Open ground inside the walls: where carts unload, children play, the well stands and the garrison musters.</p><p>A courtyard is a basic facility and makes room for things that need space. A roomy courtyard or larger is where a Training Yard can be laid out. A Bastion has only one.</p>"
