        "icon": "modules/dxcufgbs-player-bastions/assets/codex/icons/dining-room.webp",
        "description": "<p>A long table, a good fire and the whole household eating together. Shared meals are where the Bastion's people stop being strangers.</p><p>A dining room raises Comfort. It is a basic facility, and it can be enlarged as the household grows.</p>"
