        "description": "<p>The heart of any household: a great hearth, ovens, copper pots and a cook who rules it all.</p><p>A kitchen feeds the people who live at the Bastion and is needed before an Inn or a Great Hall can be built. It is a basic facility and can be enlarged.</p>"
